{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>世茂集團被接管的本港酒店，被接管人以27億元出售。</p><p></p><p>預期交易將於今年年底前完成，出售款項將首先用作償還根據債權證，及抵押作擔保的債務。今年六月，世茂旗下東涌喜來登酒店及福朋喜來登酒店，被滙豐銀行委託接管人接管。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.857606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:37:59.749475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:59.992778+00:00","content_hash":"a00ba832dd12807d8a620918c29c09fa500bcf71d05fbcebe8e2bb0a4a01a6fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}